WEBVTT

00:05:07.916 --> 00:05:39.516
(Muzikë)

00:05:39.516 --> 00:05:41.067
Faleminderit.

00:05:41.067 --> 00:05:42.983
EDI: Faleminderit!

00:05:42.983 --> 00:05:45.161
(Duartrokitje)

00:05:45.161 --> 00:05:52.232
(Muzikë)

00:05:52.262 --> 00:05:54.539
MT: Dhe kjo ishte gjithçka. Shumë faleminderit,

00:05:54.539 --> 00:05:55.228
dhe faleminderit ty, EDI.

00:05:55.228 --> 00:05:56.702
EDI: Faleminderit Marco.

00:05:56.702 --> 00:06:01.634
(Duartrokitje)